      "filePath": "newbee-mall-cloud-order-service/newbee-mall-cloud-order-web/src/main/resources/mapper/NewBeeMallOrderAddressMapper.xml",
      "summary": "MyBatis 映射配置文件，定义订单收货地址表(tb_newbee_mall_order_address)的 SQL 操作，包括主键查询、删除、全字段插入、选择性插入及主键更新，映射至 NewBeeMallOrderAddress 实体。用于记录订单快照时的收货地址信息。",
      "tags": ["configuration", "mybatis", "database", "mapper", "data-access"],
      "complexity": "simple",
      "languageNotes": "订单地址采用快照方式存储，与用户地址表独立，确保订单历史数据不受用户地址修改影响。"
    },
    {
